  "hotelDescription": "Want to sample the city sights without losing sleep? Look no further than Premier Inn Hotel Liverpool Rainhill. In a quiet setting in the welcoming village of Rainhill, you\u0027ll also be well placed to explore business and leisure destinations in Liverpool city centre. \n\nLet out your wild side at Knowsley Safari Park. Cheer on your team at Anfield Stadium. Seek out arts and culture or top-class shopping in Liverpool city centre. Or, if it\u0027s the right time of year, get in on the action at the Grand National. Then unwind in the restaurant just next door and relax in one of our new generation bedrooms, with an impressive 40\" flat screen TV, fresh modern bathroom with a large shower head and brand new, slumber-inducing king-size super comfy bed.",
